# Canonical zen fuzz crates, relative to ZEN_ROOT (~/work/zen). One per line;
# blank lines and # comments ignored. fuzz-rotate.sh fuzzes exactly these (any
# that have fuzz/fuzz_targets + libfuzzer-sys). This deliberately excludes stale
# agent worktrees (.claude/worktrees/*), scratch copies (_dbg, *-perm-corpus,
# *--* worktrees), vendored upstream (naga), the stale nested zenjxl-decoder
# sub-crate, and the AFL-only rawloader-fork (different harness). Also excludes
# the internal vendored jpegli-rs (zenjpeg/internal/.../jpegli) — its
# butteraugli-oxide workspace dep won't resolve under standalone cargo-fuzz, and
# the primary JPEG codec (zenjpeg) is already fully fuzzed. Also excludes
# zenpipe/zencodecs (the cross-codec dispatch layer, 10 targets): its fuzz crate
# is bit-rotted against the evolving codec APIs — fixed path/feature issues, but
# it still hits a rav1e EncoderConfig version-skew (zenrav1e 0.1.4's cfg(fuzzing)
# module vs newer rav1e, pulled via zenavif) that needs a dedicated dep-resync.
# Tracked in imazen/zenpipe. The underlying codecs are all fuzzed individually.
# Add a line to onboard a new crate.
aom-decoder-rs
fax
heic
image-tiff
rav1d-safe
ultrahdr
weezl
zenanalyze/zenpredict
zenavif
zenavif-parse
zenbitmaps
zencodec
zenextras/zenpdf
zenextras/zensvg
zenextras/zentiff
zenflate
zengif
zenjpeg/zenjpeg
zenjxl-decoder
zenpipe
zenpng
zenrav1e
zenraw
zentone
zenwebp
zenzstd
